    <briefdescription>
<para>Defines the <ref refid="class_decisions_trait" kindref="compound">DecisionsTrait</ref> class, a type of <ref refid="class_trait" kindref="compound">Trait</ref> that represents decision-making characteristics. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <ref refid="class_decisions_trait" kindref="compound">DecisionsTrait</ref> class extends the base <ref refid="class_trait" kindref="compound">Trait</ref> class to provide functionality for traits that can influence decisions of individuals in the simulation. It supports serialization for persistence and JSON configuration. </para>
